target/
## The pre-push hook builds the pushed commit here, not in target/.
source/rust/target-gate/
## It links that dir into its worktree as this symlink, which target/ misses:
## a trailing slash matches only a directory.
source/rust/target
## And a frozen run copy links these two in the same way (FROZEN_LINKS).
source/rust/target-migrate
cicd/artifacts
source/go/shcl
source/c/shcl
__pycache__/

## Left behind by `python -m build` in source/python at a release cut.
source/python/build/
source/python/dist/
source/python/*.egg-info/
